hadiths[257]{hadithnumber,text}:
" ","[No source text provided for translation]"
"919","Ibn Abbas reported that the delegation of Abdul Qais came to the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) and said: ""O Messenger of Allah! We are this tribe from Rabi'ah, and the disbelievers of Mudar have come between us and you, so we cannot reach you except in the sacred month. So command us with a command that we can act upon and invite those behind us to it."" He said: ""I command you with four things and forbid you from four things: Faith in Allah."" Then he explained it to them, saying: ""Testimony that there is no god but Allah and that Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah, establishing prayer, giving zakah, and that you give one-fifth of what you gain as booty."" And he forbade you from dubba, hantam, naqir, and muqayyar."
"920","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 920 Arabic Hadees: 2661"
"921","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 921 Arabic Hadees: 452"
"922","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 922 Arabic Hadees: 566"
"923","On the authority of Qutaylah bint Sayfiyy al-Juhaniyyah, she said: A scholar from the scholars came to the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) and said: ""O Muhammad! What excellent people you are, were it not that you associate partners (with Allah)."" He said: ""Glory be to Allah! And what is that?"" He said: ""You say when you swear: 'By the Ka'bah.'"" She said: So the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) paused for a while, then said: ""Indeed it has been revealed: 'So whoever swears, let him swear by the Lord of the Ka'bah.'"" He said: ""O Muhammad! What excellent people you are, were it not that you make for Allah a rival."" He said: ""Glory be to Allah! And what is that?"" He said: ""You say: 'What Allah wills and you will.'"" She said: So the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) paused for a while, then said: ""Indeed it has been revealed: 'So whoever says ""What Allah wills,"" let him say with it: ""Then you will.""'"""
"924","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 924 Arabic Hadees: 1908"
"925","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 925 Arabic Hadees: 3594"
